From f344298c9b31ed143b2f96eb573a8af1dcd95df0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reema Bajwa <reemabajwa@google.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Nov 2025 22:46:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/38] Fix bugs caused on package update events

This fix fixes two issues
- Uses the right userId when updating settings as a result of a package being updated.
- Makes sure that only the relevant user's services are visited when a given service
for that user has a package update.

Test: Unit tests
Bug: 460933604
Flag: android.credentials.flags.multi_user_fix_enabled
Cherrypick-From: https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:a631806c7aef2d0adf40793883957956aaada357
Merged-In: I0aa867f6e979a1bbb3c050d825c64b279b1fb51a
Change-Id: I0aa867f6e979a1bbb3c050d825c64b279b1fb51a
